{
  "_comment": "Single source of truth linking Doc 1 logic, Doc 3 minigame IDs and the 3D sets in data/rooms.json (Doc 4 §15). A sequence entry is a SHOT: `room` (a rooms.json key; defaults to the branch's `room`) + `shot` (a name from that room's `shots`). `loop: true` entries resolve at once and play until the next shot; others are awaited. Transitions are derived (router.js planTransition: the current room's `leave` shot, black, the next room's `arrive`); a branch's `transitions[next]` may override the pair's shot names. Flags COUNTED_DOOR (MG-02 mode H) and EARLY_EXIT (bail.js) are NOT set here -- they come from minigame onComplete().flags or the global bail-out, not from scene choices.",
  "spineOrder": [
    "S0",
    "S1",
    "S2",
    "S3",
    "S4",
    "S5",
    "S6",
    "S7",
    "S8"
  ],
  "_musicNote": "`music` (scene-level, or a per-branch override): 'muzak' | 'pad' | 'deep' | 'water' | {file} | null. Generated live by src/music.js on audio.js's music bus -- no licensed tracks. See the music.js header.",
